        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS\nPLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE\nFIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** STUNNING 1 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM APARTMENT *** IMMACULATE CONDITION *** THE CRESCENT, PARK WEST *** AVAILABLE NOW ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS proudly present this superb one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the rental market, ideally located in the highly sought-after The Crescent, Park West, Dublin 12.\nThis bright and well-presented apartment offers comfortable and well-proportioned living accommodation throughout. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living/dining area, a modern fitted kitchen, one generous double bedroom, and a main bathroom.\nThe apartment is ideally positioned within the popular Park West development, offering a range of local amenities and excellent transport links. Park West & Cherry Orchard Train Station is within easy reach, while numerous Dublin Bus routes provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The development also offers excellent access to the M50, N4 and all major road networks, making commuting simple and convenient.\nViewing is highly recommended.\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Stunning 1 Bed / 1 Bath apartment</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious open-plan living/dining area</li>\n <li>Modern fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>One generous double bedroom</li>\n <li>Main bathroom</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\n <li>Close to Park West & Cherry Orchard Train Station</li>\n <li>Easy access to the M50, N4 and Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Well-maintained residential development</li>\n <li>Available immediately</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS \nEMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE.\n"
